# Regression checks before every push

Before `git push`, always:

1. Update `tests/test_regressions.py` when behavior changed, so the new cases are locked in.
2. Run `python -m unittest tests.test_regressions` and wait until it passes.
3. Push only after that run is green. If it fails, fix the code or the tests first. Do not push a red suite.

This applies to every push in this project, including small fixes.
